Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.55,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.55,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,そういえば、\nお昼ごはんがまだでしたね。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:10.90,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:10.90,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,あそこのファミレスに寄ろう。\n冷房の効いた空間を、体が求めてる。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:13.52,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:13.52,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,はい。そうしましょう。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.07,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.07,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,おお……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:22.21,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:22.21,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,美鈴、美鈴。ちょうど、\n夏の大激辛フェアをやってるらしい。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.20,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.20,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,大激辛…………
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:27.43,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:27.43,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,いくつか頼んで、\nふたりでシェアしよう？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:33.20,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:33.20,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,シェアするのは構いませんが、\n激辛以外にもおいしそうな料理が――
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:37.85,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:37.85,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,これはどう？\n真っ赤に染まった『灼熱の<r\=マーラータン>麻辣湯</r>』。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.60,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.60,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,……こちらの冷製パスタは\nいかがでしょうか。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:46.37,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:46.37,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,熱く煮えたぎる『爆裂麻婆豆腐』。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:51.83,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:51.83,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,……低カロリーな、\n豆腐ハンバーグなども良いですね。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:53.72,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:53.72,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,………………
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.04,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.04,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,………………
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.81,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.81,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,なるほど。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:58.50,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:58.50,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,どうしましたか？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:02.40,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:02.40,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,美鈴。辛いもの、苦手？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:04.57,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:04.57,Campus Common,美鈴,0,0,0,,なんの話でしょう？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:08.38,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:08.38,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,ふふ。たぶん当たり。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:13.12,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:13.12,Campus Common,広,0,0,0,,ふたりでおいしく食べられる料理、\nもう少し、探してみよ。
